[{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人！早上了哦，快起来快起来」","art":{"background":"a562","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔、唔唔唔唔……」","art":{"background":"a562","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「别迷糊了，快起床。不然早上的锻炼要迟到了」","art":{"background":"a563","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……唔唔呜呜……」","art":{"background":"a563","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那种锻炼哪里留情了啊……呜呜……」","art":{"background":"a563","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「喔……原来不是呻吟声是哭声吗……」","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"自从外公开始重新锻炼我，已经过去好几天了。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a572","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"项目已经定了下来，我每天都会遵循指示锻炼。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a572","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"早上的锻炼目的是增强肌肉和体力。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a572","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这个还好。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a572","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"辛苦的是放学后借用公民馆做的锻炼。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"先是花１个半小时做准备运动、步法练习以及各种素振。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"再花一个半小时左右练切返和挂稽古。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"除此之外，还有用来习惯真剑的重量和长度的素振等练习。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这些锻炼会花上三到三个半小时，不过并不会严格地算时间。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在外公说结束之前，我都必须不停地挥打。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"而一旦有松懈的样子，就会吃到外公毫不留情的一击。","art":{"background":"a580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「只是回想起来就反胃……呕」","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在外公看来，可能他觉得自已已经手下留情了。","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但我不过是个业余的，就算是当年练剑道时，都没做过这么正儿八经的锻炼！","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过祟神才不会听这种借口……」","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"请求外公指导自己时，我就有一定程度的心理准备了。","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"可我实在没想到会累成这样……","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我这就起床，你先让开」","art":{"background":"a581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「——嘿咻」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[{"asset":"a128","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"她身体轻飘飘地飘到空中，从我身上离开。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[{"asset":"a128","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"……飘在空中的她就好像完全没有重量一样，但是坐在我肚子上时，却又能感受到实实在在的重量。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[{"asset":"a128","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的存在真是神奇。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[{"asset":"a128","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「今天也请多多指教」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a569","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「好。那么还是老样子，先跳绳，再折返跑」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a570","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是！」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a570","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"接下来，我和往常一样开始进行基础训练。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为早上以锻炼下肢为主，我的腿硬得都打不过来弯。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我用远比平常慢的速度走回房间，换上制服，可是……","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「光是换个衣服身体都疼啊……」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"为了尽量不弄疼身体，我慢慢地换衣服。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"结果因为换得太慢，浪费了不少时间。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不好意思，让你久等了」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「最近你起得很晚啊，是怎么了？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个……有点……睡过头了……吧……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……睡过头？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a583","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「难道是熬夜了？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……有各种原因……哈哈哈」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我并没有熬夜。倒不如说，因为每天做的那些锻炼，导致我一进被窝马上就睡着。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后又早早起来去锻炼……","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"除了换衣服会花不少时间，有时锻炼本身也会延长，导致每次早饭我总是姗姗来迟。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「松懈乃事故之源。这不是个好习惯」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个……你说的很对」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不用勉强自己非得陪着我们祓禊。我更希望你能老老实实呆在家里」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……你教训得是」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「好了好了，芳乃大人，先不说这些了，来吃早饭吧」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a585","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在第一天以后，我就特意避免被常陆看到。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a585","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"所以说，应该没有引起她的怀疑。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a585","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"说不定她也察觉到了什么……不过我也没必要自寻烦恼。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a584","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a585","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「对了，早饭的煎蛋要几成熟？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a586","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a587","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃・将臣","text":"『啊，我要半熟』","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a492","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a587","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武你……也要半熟？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a478","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a587","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有地……你也是？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a478","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「果然还是半熟好啊，可以享受半熟鸡蛋那种滑腻的口感，又可以把蛋黄和蛋白混在一起吃下，吃法多种多样」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a478","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「说的没错！而且，我非常喜欢那种软绵绵的口感」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a588","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「我倒是觉得硬的蛋黄也挺好吃，那种炸得焦脆的蛋白我也特别喜欢」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a244","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我倒也不是不喜欢硬的，可相比之下——」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a244","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我还是喜欢半熟」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a589","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「就是就是！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a589","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我知道了」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a585","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「不好意思啊，提这么多要求」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a248","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a494","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哪里哪里，这点要求没什么大不了的」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a248","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a590","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那么调味料要怎么办呢？要浇什么？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a248","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a591","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那当然是要——」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a248","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a591","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃・将臣","text":"「——调味酱！」\n「——酱油！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a592","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a592","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a478","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「肯定要配酱油啊」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a478","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「明明是调味酱才对」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a593","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「酱油！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a593","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「调味酱！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a594","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「酱油是歪门邪道！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a495","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你那才是歪门邪道好不好！」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a495","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「又来了啊。这两人在这方面的喜好真是完全不同」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a595","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……以后过日子没准都会因为鸡蛋吵起来」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a480","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「但是除了鸡蛋，还有饭团的馅、乌冬面和荞麦面的喜好、咖喱是甜是辣……莫非两人就是不合？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a243","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「（怒火中烧）」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a596","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（咬牙切齿）」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a596","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「你们两人都冷静一下，每个人的口味都不一样的」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a248","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「比如说我，就喜欢在煎蛋上面浇炼乳」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a245","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃・茉子・将臣","text":"「这太荒唐了」\n「怎么能配炼乳」\n「太离谱了」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a597","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a598","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「连茉子都这么说！？无法被人理解真是寂寞啊……呜呜」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a258","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「我说，其实你们关系很好的吧？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a243","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……呃……」","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"或许是因为早上的锻炼耗尽了体力的缘故，导致我现在上坡非常吃力。","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"每当想要迈大步，大腿就感到一阵酥麻。","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"没想到上个坡会这么难。说不定我脚底都磨出泡了。","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来要辛苦一段时间了……","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[{"asset":"a582","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"比奈实","text":"「啊，已经响铃了」","art":{"background":"a528","sprites":[{"asset":"a525","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"比奈实","text":"「那么今天的课先上到这里」","art":{"background":"a528","sprites":[{"asset":"a526","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"同学们都是一副等不及放学的样子，开始麻利地收拾教科书和笔记本。","art":{"background":"a528","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"比奈实","text":"「那么，大家明天见。一定要注意安全，不要发生意外」","art":{"background":"a528","sprites":[{"asset":"a526","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好……」","art":{"background":"a528","sprites":[{"asset":"a526","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我也要去做放学后的锻炼了。","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「有地，今天什么时候回去？」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a583","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可能会晚一点。啊，但是应该会在天黑之前回去」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a583","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「是吗，我知道了」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a600","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这几天你放学后都是去哪儿了？在做什么？」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a594","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哎？啊，这个嘛……也、也没什么大事……一些小事吧」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a594","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「别在意！」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a594","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那我先走了」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a594","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我逃也似的离开了教室。","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「芳乃大人，我们回去吧」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a491","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……真可疑……」","art":{"background":"a599","sprites":[{"asset":"a601","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a491","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「你来了啊。那么去公民馆吧」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a91","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a91","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「啊，对了。将臣，这周六你有空吗？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a107","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「周六？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a107","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「学校不上课的吧？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a90","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「目前是没什么事……难道要搞特训？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a90","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「别一脸那么不情愿的表情，不是你想的那样」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a602","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「锻炼还是和平常一样」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是吗」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我是应该为没有增加锻炼量而高兴呢……还是应该为周六也必须锻炼而悲伤呢……","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"不，祟神可不会管这么多。","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我必须舍弃想偷懒的念头，努力锻炼自己。","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过，既然不是特训，那究竟是什么事呢？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「其实是想拜托你当向导」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a93","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「向导？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a93","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-4"}]